{
  "cards": [
    {
      "id": "nats-01",
      "verdict": "supported",
      "fact": "资料说明 MaxMsgs、MaxBytes 与 MaxAge 作为基本上限适用于所有 retention policies；在 WorkQueuePolicy 和 InterestPolicy 下这些 age、size 与 count limits 仍保留为上限。",
      "citations": [
        {
          "source": "nats",
          "start": 11,
          "end": 13
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "nats-02",
      "verdict": "refuted",
      "fact": "WorkQueuePolicy 不允许重叠消费者；资料明确说明同一 subject 在该模式下一次只能有一个消费者。",
      "citations": [
        {
          "source": "nats",
          "start": 9,
          "end": 9
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "nats-03",
      "verdict": "supported",
      "fact": "在 InterestPolicy 下，消息会保留直到所有当前定义且匹配该消息 subject 的消费者均已显式确认；同时基本 limits 仍作为上限。",
      "citations": [
        {
          "source": "nats",
          "start": 10,
          "end": 13
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "nats-04",
      "verdict": "supported",
      "fact": "可以；资料指出 NATS 默认有自身的最大消息大小限制（1 MiB），而 stream 可通过 MaxMsgSize 设置更低的接受上限。",
      "citations": [
        {
          "source": "nats",
          "start": 14,
          "end": 14
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "nats-05",
      "verdict": "supported",
      "fact": "DiscardOld 删除旧消息以为新消息腾出空间；DiscardNew 拒绝新消息。",
      "citations": [
        {
          "source": "nats",
          "start": 15,
          "end": 15
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "nats-06",
      "verdict": "refuted",
      "fact": "发布去重依据 Nats-Msg-Id 头部识别重复，而不是比较消息 body；资料明确说只查看 message ID，不查看 body。",
      "citations": [
        {
